00:53:00,720 --> 00:53:09,720
 is that you get huge volume numbers, which may not necessarily reflect meaningful economic activity.

348
00:53:09,720 --> 00:53:13,720
 Rebalancing my balance is not real economic activity.

349
00:53:13,720 --> 00:53:17,720
 You know, it's like taking your wallet out of your pocket doesn't count as spending.

350
00:53:17,720 --> 00:53:20,720
 Whereas actually spending is a different behavior.

351
00:53:20,720 --> 00:53:31,720
 This 10 trillion adjusted number is our attempt to filter out many of the most obvious, sort of not economically meaningful transfers

