00:53:31,720 --> 00:53:36,720
 to try to get something a little bit closer to, you know, someone deposited money to an exchange.

353
00:53:36,720 --> 00:53:38,720
 You know, that's meaningful.

354
00:53:38,720 --> 00:53:40,720
 Someone making a payment, that's meaningful.

